<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Loraine Sept qtr profit falls.</title>
<headline>Loraine Sept qtr profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Sept versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit before capital spending	   4.58 vs   5.52</p>
<p>    Capital spending				   0.53 vs   2.37</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled				   381,000 vs 387,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)				  1,601 vs   1,639</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)				    4.2   vs   4.2</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)				   52,943 vs  48,520</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)				54,763 vs  51,733</p>
<p>Full name: Loraine Gold Mines Ltd, managed by Anglovaal Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
